# <type>[optional scope]: <imperative summary>
#
# [optional body: explain why and externally visible behavior]
#
# [optional footer(s), for example: Closes #123 or BREAKING CHANGE: ...]
#
# Allowed types:
#   feat     player-visible behavior
#   fix      defect correction
#   balance  roster, item, or AI tuning
#   build    build system or dependencies
#   ci       GitHub Actions and automation
#   docs     documentation only
#   refactor internal change without behavior change
#   perf     performance improvement
#   test     tests or verification
#   chore    maintenance outside the categories above
#
# Rules:
# - Keep the summary at 72 characters or fewer.
# - Use lowercase type and an optional concise scope.
# - Use imperative mood and omit a trailing period.
# - Separate the body and footers with blank lines.
# - Mark breaking changes with ! and a BREAKING CHANGE footer.
# - Do not use vague summaries such as "updates" or "fix stuff".
